  "instance_name": "prayer_scene_metaphor",
  "label": "Prayer Scene as Metaphor for Reverence",
  "description": "The visual of a person kneeling before a light source is a common metaphor in art and media to represent spiritual devotion, supplication, or reverence. In this meme, the silhouette is used to symbolize the profound respect and gratitude owed to bomb disposal experts. The metaphor implies that their work is so perilous and awe-inspiring that it warrants a form of spiritual or divine acknowledgment, which may be seen as a romanticized or overly spiritualized framing of their experience.",
